this.m.BackgroundDescription = "Those warriors dedicated their lives to their god in exchange of their help in the battle, sometimes, these same warriors enlist in mercenary companies to help their tribes and serve their gods.";
		this.m.GoodEnding = "%name% finally achieved his legacy of Chosen, he fought for so long that his god gave him more and more mutations, he accepted them easily and when his time came, he was warmly welcome into Valhalla.";
